  "releaseNotes": "## New Version\n* Bump `nuke_build_helpers` from `9.0.19` to `9.0.20`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/compare/nuke_build_helpers/9.0.19...nuke_build_helpers/9.0.20)\n\n## What's Changed\n* Override vulnerable transitive dependencies with patched versions by @Copilot in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/pull/271\n* Bump YamlDotNet from 17.0.1 to 17.1.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/pull/276\n\n## New Contributors\n* @Copilot made their first contribution in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/pull/271\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NukeBuildHelpers/compare/build.20260428143814.cfa7b4d...build.20260429144045.7f61ff3",
